course: dictionary
lesson: 15305
title: Words with less
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: The word sleepless is made of two parts: sleep and less. The ending -less means without, so sleepless means without sleep. Other words work the same way: careless means without care, and harmless means without harm.
explain: «Sam had a sleepless night before his birthday trip.» Sam hardly slept because he was too excited. Check it: swap in "awake" and the sentence still makes sense.
explain: Sleepless can also mean not able to sleep because of worry, excitement or pain. «Mum was sleepless with worry when the storm came.» The clue is worry: she could not sleep because she was anxious.
fact: Sleepless means without sleep, or not able to sleep.
fact: The ending -less means without, so careless means without care.
fact: «A sleepless night» is a night when you do not sleep much at all.
fact: People can be sleepless because of worry, excitement or pain.
fact: Sleep helps memory and mood, so too many sleepless nights can make learning and feeling good much harder.
exercise: «After the noisy storm, Ava had a sleepless night.» What does sleepless mean here? | Very sleepy in class the next day | *Not able to sleep | Very tired after running | Happy and full of energy
exercise: Which word means without care? | caring | *careless | careful | carefully
exercise: «Sleepless with worry, the girl waited by the phone.» Why was she sleepless? | Because she was reading a good book | *Because she was worried | Because she had a fun party | Because the room was very warm
test: «The baby cried all night, and the parents were sleepless.» What is the main reason they were sleepless? | Their room was too bright | They had eaten too much cake | *The crying kept them awake | They were playing games late
test: Which statement about sleepless nights is true? | Sleepless nights have no effect on memory | *Too many sleepless nights can make learning harder | Sleepless nights make you grow taller | Sleepless nights are always fun
exam: «He stared at the ceiling, sleepless and restless.» What does sleepless mean here? | Happy and playful | *Not able to sleep | Very full after a big dinner | Lost in a maze
